{
  "name": "Cocoon",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-carved-stone-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Encases the target in a cocoon for one day, after which it regains all its Health and heals up to two Grave Wounds.</p><p>On waking it eats twice as much as usual for a day. Most targets find the experience traumatic and take a Resolve test.</p><p>If the cocoon is interrupted, the target gains one Grave Wound and must pass an Advanced Endurance test or be hamstrung for one round. Can only be used once every five days.</p>",
